dimension.normalization:
Hash the user name like follows, where s represents the user name:

int hashCode = s[0]*31^(n-1) + s[1]*31^(n-2) + ... + s[n-1];
int dimensionValue = hashCode & 0x7fffffff;

Divide the UuidArrayOfHLAbyte16 into two int64, mostSigBits and leastSigBits

int64 hilo = mostSigBits ^ leastSigBits;
int hashCode = ((int)(hilo >> 32)) ^ (int) hilo;
int dimensionValue = hashCode & 0x7fffffff;

Divide the UuidArrayOfHLAbyte16 into two int64, mostSigBits and leastSigBits

int64 hilo = mostSigBits ^ leastSigBits;
int hashCode = ((int)(hilo >> 32)) ^ (int) hilo;
int dimensionValue = hashCode & 0x7fffffff;
